dules, brand kit details and replies."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Usage data:"}]," log data such as IP address, browser type and actions in the app, used for security and support."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. How we use it"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To publish and schedule content, show analytics, and run the unified inbox, leads and ads features you use."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To power Podo AI features (for example writing captions or drafting replies). The relevant content is sent to our AI provider, Anthropic, to generate a response. It is not used to train their models."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To keep the service secure, prevent abuse, provide support, and meet legal obligations."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell personal data, and we do not use data from Meta platforms for advertising profiles or resale."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. Sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We share data only with:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"The platforms you connect (for example Meta), to carry out the actions you request."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Service providers that host or process data for us (cloud hosting, database, AI processing), under contract."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Your own CRM, if you turn on lead sync."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Authorities, when required by law."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Security and retention"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Platform access tokens are encrypted at rest (AES-256-GCM) and never shown in the app. Data is kept while your workspace is active. When you disconnect an account, its tokens are deleted. When you delete your workspace or ask us to, we delete the associated data within 30 days, except where we must keep records by law."}]]}],"$L11","$L12"]}],"$L13"]}],null,"$L14"]}]
